{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monero-project/monero/pulls/11283","id":4491620977,"node_id":"PR_kwDOASa_i88AAAABC7iycQ","html_url":"https://github.com/monero-project/monero/pull/11283","diff_url":"https://github.com/monero-project/monero/pull/11283.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/monero-project/monero/pull/11283.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monero-project/monero/issues/11283","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monero-project/monero/pulls/11283/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monero-project/monero/pulls/11283/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monero-project/monero/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monero-project/monero/issues/11283/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monero-project/monero/statuses/a58e7b0227d9a29fb3a20068f019b1b6a561b17e","number":11283,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"p2p: don't drop peers who re-relay invalid blocks with good PoW","user":{"login":"j-berman","id":26468430,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NDY4NDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26468430?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-berman","html_url":"https://github.com/j-berman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-berman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-berman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-berman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-berman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-berman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-berman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-berman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-berman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-berman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Idea proposed by @boog900 [here](https://github.com/seraphis-migration/monero/issues/454).\r\n\r\nSome nodes in the future may re-relay blocks immediately after PoW checks pass, but before expensive validation occurs, in order to speed up block propagation around the network. Therefore an honest node could be \"tricked\" into re-relaying an invalid block that has valid PoW.\r\n\r\nThus, we don't want to drop connections to nodes that re-relay invalid blocks with good PoW since they could be honest.\r\n\r\nRe-relaying blocks immediately after PoW checks pass and before expensive validation would be more beneficial with FCMP++, since blocks can take seconds to validate, and therefore take many seconds to propagate to the whole network.","labels":[{"id":346541963,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNDY1NDE5NjM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monero-project/monero/labels/pending%20review","name":"pending review","description":null,"color":"fbca04","default":false},{"id":6305215000,"node_id":"LA_kwDOASa_i88AAAABd9HyGA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monero-project/monero/labels/daemon","name":"daemon","description":"","color":"83180F","default":false}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-09-10T03:33:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-12T00:06:21Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"ab94c455e454d4f9f11147edaec0c785238ceed5","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"j-berman:no-ban-invalid-blk","ref":"no-ban-invalid-blk","repo":{"id":384913558,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkzODQ5MTM1NTg=","name":"monero","full_name":"j-berman/monero","owner":{"login":"j-berman","id":26468430,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NDY4NDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26468430?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-berman","html_url":"https://github.com/j-berman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-berman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-berman/following{/other_user}","